			"notes": "## What's Changed\n* Fixed RPG Series compatibility by @scarzehd in https://github.com/scarzehd/nulls_armory/pull/12\n* Added compatibility for vanilla enchantments. Removed RPG Series compat as it is no longer necessary by @scarzehd in https://github.com/scarzehd/nulls_armory/pull/13\n* Reverted changes that broke things (literally!) by @scarzehd in https://github.com/scarzehd/nulls_armory/pull/14\n* Rebalanced the Orthos Prime and fixed a crash by @scarzehd in https://github.com/scarzehd/nulls_armory/pull/15\n* Fixed crash relating to Null Lull sign generation. Again. by @scarzehd in https://github.com/scarzehd/nulls_armory/pull/16\n* b1.2.0 by @scarzehd in https://github.com/scarzehd/nulls_armory/pull/17\n* Mod version is now 1.2.0 by @scarzehd in https://github.com/scarzehd/nulls_armory/pull/18\n* Replaced turtle scutes with obsidian in the Trench Resonator crafting recipe by @scarzehd in https://github.com/scarzehd/nulls_armory/pull/19\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/scarzehd/nulls_armory/compare/1.0.0...1.2.1"
